05 start date, weekends, and the 2026-10-12 company holiday produces a launch date of 2026-10-23 — one business day later than the 2026-10-22 date recorded in the delivery packet's summary. Worth confirming with the delivery team whether the holiday was properly accounted for in their plan.\n- **Security:** Incident resolution (76 of 80 detected) checks out at 95.0%, matching the packet. No escalation needed here.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1221,"cache_read_input_tokens":36036,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1221},"output_tokens":3,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"0fe75023-18f3-4690-8c63-2b4db91ca382","uuid":"4a73d0d2-ebdc-4dfb-9ece-70fe9d0f90ab","timestamp":"2026-08-22T06:45:40.615Z","request_id":"req_011CeHLRVpwQwJJywQqfpx64"}
